// ASW visual design remains controlled by the RIGHT runtime; this LEFT block is
// prompt/render authority only for the upcoming Discovery > Visions workspace.
// ============================================================================
// ######################################################
// ## 🖼 MORO IMAGE ENGINE V21K — SAFE SIGNATURE KEY FIX / NO BROKEN LISTS
