loop_free_composition_pool
  balanced hero composition, clear focal point, clean figure-ground separation, readable silhouette, enough background context to feel complete
  strong editorial composition, subject placed with intentional negative space, clean visual hierarchy, polished final-frame clarity
  cinematic key art composition, subject readable at thumbnail size, atmospheric surrounding space, no clutter

loop_character_composition_pool
  three-quarter character framing, head to upper knees or full outfit visible, face readable, outfit details clear, pose natural and expressive, background supports identity
  centered character card composition, single character, readable face and hands, strong costume silhouette, contextual background with depth and mood
  dynamic character portrait, one primary figure, clear gesture, readable anatomy, full costume logic, atmospheric environment behind the character

loop_world_composition_pool
  wide establishing shot, layered foreground midground background, strong horizon logic, visible architecture terrain weather and atmosphere, no portrait focus
  immersive environment composition, viewer placed inside the world, strong depth cues, readable geography, rich background storytelling
  cinematic location card, wide scene scale, environmental landmark, lived-in details, atmosphere and light defining the world identity

loop_map_composition_pool
  readable fantasy map composition, terrain masses and routes clearly separated, landmarks and zone anchors visible, balanced cartographic layout
  top-down or parchment-style map view, clear coastlines borders paths and settlement marks, strong world geography, no portrait subject
  atlas plate composition, legible regions, routes and points of interest, environment identity shown through map symbols and terrain shapes

loop_story_composition_pool
  cinematic scene blocking, subject action readable, emotional tension visible, clear relationship between figure and environment, no generic posing
  narrative frame, moment of consequence, character gesture and setting work together, dramatic foreground and background staging
  story still composition, clear action line, readable expression, setting reinforces the plot beat, cinematic depth and timing

