loop_free_camera_pool
  natural lens perspective, not too close, not too far, subject fully readable
  cinematic medium-wide framing, stable perspective, polished key visual view
  clean camera angle, strong readability, no accidental crop

loop_character_camera_pool
  slightly low or eye-level portrait camera, face and costume readable, no cropped head, no cropped hands
  medium portrait lens, full character identity visible, body proportions clear, background softly contextual
  clean character card camera, controlled perspective, face readable, outfit and gesture visible

loop_world_camera_pool
  wide-angle establishing camera, stable horizon, readable spatial scale, environment takes priority
  panoramic environment view, atmospheric depth, foreground elements guide the eye into the scene
  location preview camera, wide readable scene, terrain and architecture coherent

loop_map_camera_pool
  map view, stable top-down or atlas perspective, full geography readable, no cinematic camera distortion
  clear cartographic viewpoint, terrain and route structure prioritized over atmosphere, no close character framing
  atlas-style map plate, coherent spatial scale, regions and landmarks readable at thumbnail size

loop_story_camera_pool
  cinematic lens-aware framing, action readable, emotional expression visible, scene depth clear
  film still camera, dramatic but understandable angle, no confusing crop, clear narrative blocking
  medium-wide story camera, character and setting visible together, tension readable

