  intentional cinematic lighting, soft depth, polished contrast, subject clearly readable
  atmospheric light, controlled shadows, visual mood without losing clarity
  clean dramatic lighting, readable detail, refined color temperature

loop_character_lighting_pool
  flattering character key light, readable face, subtle rim light, costume detail clarity, background separated by atmosphere
  cinematic anime portrait lighting, expressive eyes, soft ambient background glow, clear silhouette
  clean avatar lighting, readable anatomy and costume, dimensional key light, contextual background illumination

loop_world_lighting_pool
  environmental lighting defines the location, atmospheric haze, deep spatial layers, natural sky or source light
  golden hour or moonlit environmental mood, coherent shadows, architecture and terrain readable
  weather-shaped light, volumetric atmosphere, clear foreground midground background depth

loop_map_lighting_pool
  even atlas lighting, high readability, terrain symbols and route marks clear, balanced contrast, calm cartographic illumination
  parchment or engraved map lighting, readable ink contrast, subtle material texture, continuous region clarity
  soft cartographic illumination, symbolic cartographic marks, region boundaries and landmarks remain visually clear

loop_story_lighting_pool
  dramatic scene lighting, emotion-driven contrast, readable action, character and environment integrated
  cinematic practical light, motivated shadows, story tension visible, clean shadow separation
  atmospheric narrative lighting, clear faces and gestures, scene mood supports the story beat

