loop_background_free
  finished background appropriate to the subject, not empty, not plain white, enough environment to feel complete

loop_background_character
  contextual atmospheric background tied to character identity, subtle environment cues, no blank studio backdrop, no isolated transparent PNG look

loop_background_world
  environment is the main subject, rich worldbuilding details, architecture terrain weather culture and scale visible, no character portrait takeover

loop_background_map
  map background supports navigation, terrain landmasses paths borders landmarks and zone anchors are clear, no single character subject, no plain empty backdrop

loop_background_story
  background carries story consequence, setting shows where the scene happens, environmental details support action and emotion

