loop_core_loop_style_v1
  ASW Core Style v1: silent mythic realism with cinematic restraint, clear focal composition, and atmospheric world memory. Keep the image elegant, readable, and emotionally quiet; use ancient cultural traces, subtle legendary presence, worn materials, mist, ritual detail, and restrained fantasy realism where they support the subject. Favor restrained ornament, grounded fantasy language, controlled detail hierarchy, believable structure, controlled color separation, soft environmental depth, and a finished key-visual polish that feels mysterious, explorable, and dignified.

loop_core_anime
  anime-based visual language, expressive character design, clean readable anatomy, cinematic anime lighting, polished key visual clarity, emotional readability, refined line and color discipline

loop_core_cinematic
  cinematic realism, grounded photographic atmosphere, believable textures, filmic composition, natural light behavior, realistic spatial depth, restrained color grading, high credibility

loop_core_comic
  comic visual language, ink-led graphic storytelling, panel-minded sequential image design, strong line authority, bold silhouette control, graphic shadow architecture, clear value separation, expressive but controlled anatomy, dynamic panel energy, clean print clarity

loop_core_3d
  stylized 3D render language, polished materials, clean geometry, coherent lighting, refined surfaces, cinematic depth, character or environment rendered with controlled detail



loop_core_high_fantasy
  high fantasy visual language, mythic illustration and heroic fantasy painting fused into one core, ancient world depth, painterly atmosphere, readable fantasy silhouettes, lore-rich environment detail, epic landscape scale, ceremonial costume logic, mythic architecture, dramatic but coherent light, classic storybook grandeur and high-adventure visual force

