loop_core_signature_dominance_layer
  primary visual grammar must follow the selected Render Core first; the chosen Style Flavor must then strongly steer the image within that core using its own recognizable visual authority; do not let the result drift back into generic anime, generic comic, or generic 3D once a specific Style Flavor has been chosen; preserve the core medium while letting the selected influence actively shape silhouette language, lighting behavior, color design, rendering behavior, atmosphere, and detail emphasis

