loop_quality_layer
  highly polished final image, coherent anatomy, coherent perspective, strong composition, clean readable silhouette, intentional lighting, natural depth, no accidental clutter, no UI text, no watermark, refined detail control

loop_beginner_assist_layer
  if the user prompt is simple, expand it into a complete image with clear subject, fitting background, coherent lighting, readable pose, visual mood, and finished composition; do not require professional prompt wording

