here, graphic tension", "comic__ink_heavy_comic_style": "assertive black placement, forceful contour dominance, dense graphic texture, dramatic punch, high-impact page contrast", "comic__halftone_print_comic_style": "print-texture charm, dot-pattern graphics, retro tonal breakup, vintage reproduction character, mechanical print flair", "3d_render__beeple_3d_surreal_style": "high-gloss surreal design polish, bold form exaggeration, dramatic lighting punch, clean material contrast, concept-driven spectacle",   "3d_render__ian_hubert_vfx_realism_style": "practical VFX credibility, grounded surface response, believable compositing logic, efficient realism, tactile spatial coherence", "3d_render__maciej_kuciara_concept_realism_style": "concept-art realism, elegant shape authority, cinematic industrial polish, high-end design coherence, premium visual sophistication", "3d_render__sebastien_hue_stylized_3d_look": "stylized clean forms, polished animation-grade surfacing, friendly readability, graphic lighting clarity, soft premium finish",  "3d_render__paul_chadeisson_sci_fi_environment_style": "epic scale feeling, layered atmospheric depth, industrial-futurist mood, meticulous design coherence, immersive spatial richness",  "3d_render__simon_stalenhag_hybrid_realism_style": "soft retro-futurist melancholy, subdued palette intelligence, atmospheric stillness, tactile realism, quiet speculative mood",  "3d_render__avatar_2009_cgi_visual_style": "luminous organic surfacing, rich color bloom, immersive atmospheric layering, premium fantasy-CGI polish, fluid visual harmony",   "3d_render__avengers_cinematic_vfx_style": "high-end blockbuster polish, premium spectacle coherence, crisp effects integration, bold readability, polished large-scale finish", "3d_render__dune_2021_cgi_environment_look": "sculpted atmospheric austerity, minimalist monumentality, restrained tonal grandeur, refined environmental scale, elegant harshness",  "3d_render__alita_battle_angel_character_rendering_style": "refined character-surface polish, expressive face clarity, premium hybrid realism, sleek detailing, high-fidelity motion-ready finish", "3d_render__spider_man_into_the_spider_verse_hybrid_3d_style": "stylized hybrid rendering, graphic texture interplay, bold color punctuation, experimental comic-3D fusion, kinetic visual punch", "3d_render__final_fantasy_cgi_film_style": "luxurious cinematic CGI polish, elegant character rendering, luminous detail control, premium fantasy-tech sheen, graceful realism",  "3d_render__stylized_3d_render_style": "clean stylization, simplified shape appeal, polished surfacing, readable form hierarchy, premium animation-like finish",        "3d_render__modern_disney_feature_animation_style": "appealing stylization, soft premium surfacing, warm expressive polish, family-feature clarity, elegant animation finish", "3d_render__pixar_inspired_stylized_3d_animation_style": "friendly form appeal, soft rounded polish, clean emotional readability, premium stylized surfacing, bright character-centric clarity", "3d_render__dreamworks_character_animation_style": "snappy stylization, expressive silhouette appeal, polished comedic clarity, premium animated confidence, readable pose energy", "3d_render__arcane_fortiche_painterly_animation_style": "painterly-textured 3D, brush-inflected surfacing, dramatic contrast, expressive face emphasis, premium stylized atmosphere", "3d_render__laika_stop_motion_cinematic_style": "crafted tactile texture, miniature-like material charm, carefully staged lighting, handmade polish, intimate cinematic atmosphere",    "high_fantasy__frank_frazetta_painting_style": "classic pulp fantasy oil-painting force, muscular brush energy, sculptural anatomy, compressed heroic silhouette rhythm, smoky dramatic chiaroscuro, hot earth-metal color, primal mythic intensity", "high_fantasy__boris_vallejo_heroic_fantasy_painting_style": "smooth heroic idealization, polished anatomical clarity, glossy fantasy painting finish, d