, adventurous atmosphere, approachable mythic charm, cinematic whimsy, illustrated grandeur", "high_fantasy__marc_simonetti_realistic_fantasy_style": "architectural scale intelligence, refined realism, atmospheric world-building depth, elegant monumental mood, thoughtful fantasy precision", "high_fantasy__magali_villeneuve_detailed_semi_realistic_style": "refined semi-realism, graceful detail density, elegant fantasy polish, soft luminous atmosphere, character-friendly painterly finish", "loop_core_style_v1__grounded_ghibli_realism": "Studio Ghibli and Hayao Miyazaki grounded feature-animation visual language, Spirited Away, The Wind Rises, and Castle in the Sky used as visual references for hand-painted background softness, humane gesture, warm color restraint, tactile atmosphere, clean readable shapes, gentle motion sensitivity, and emotional clarity", "loop_core_style_v1__disney_atelier": "classic Disney feature-animation atelier style, Fantasia and classic Disney feature-animation atelier work used for visual reference, elegant hand-drawn draftsmanship, graceful silhouette design, appealing gesture, storybook color harmony, clean staging", "loop_core_style_v1__franco_belgian_lumiere": "Franco-Belgian ligne claire discipline, clear strong contour, clean unhatched line fields, even readable color fields, downplayed contrast, precise silhouette language, lucid staging, crisp European album-comic composition", "loop_core_style_v1__moebius_horizon": "Moebius clean-line sci-fantasy clarity, exact elegant contour, airy flat color, surreal calm, spacious negative space, strange graphic dream logic, precise imaginative readability", "loop_core_style_v1__graphic_nocturne": "Graphic Nocturne visual style, controlled black-shape design, shadow-led composition, restrained color fields, tactile ink-painterly texture, severe graphic rhythm, serious atmospheric tension", "loop_core_style_v1__majestic_reverie": "Majestic Reverie fantasy illustration style, luminous romantic fantasy painting, graceful painterly detail, radiant soft light, elevated composition, refined color harmony, poetic grandeur, polished dreamlike finish",}; let txt=map[key]||""; if(!txt) return ""; return "selected style flavor behavior: "+txt+". This controls how the subject is drawn, never what objects are added.";}catch(e){return ""}})()]

loop_style_content_safety_layer
  Core and Style Flavor control how the subject is drawn: line, color, light, texture, composition, material handling, mood, and visual energy. The user subject remains the content authority.

loop_core_quality_booster_layer
  refined ASW fantasy image, silent mythic realism, cinematic restraint, atmospheric polish, elegant readable detail, controlled color separation, quiet finished-key-visual quality ^[loopDraftRenderCore == "MORO Core Style v1" ? 1 : 0]
  masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, highly detailed, visually refined, polished finish, clean image fidelity, strong visual coherence, excellent detail control, production-grade anime quality ^[loopDraftRenderCore == "Anime" ? 1 : 0]
  masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, highly detailed, premium cinematic image, high-end film still quality, refined photoreal detail, excellent light control, strong tonal fidelity, production-grade cinematic finish ^[loopDraftRenderCore == "Cinematic Realism" ? 1 : 0]
  masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, highly detailed, polished comic artwork, clean ink fidelity, excellent graphic contrast, refined line control, strong print clarity, production-grade comic finish ^[loopDraftRenderCore == "Comic" ? 1 : 0]
  masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, highly detailed, premium 3D render quality, refined material fidelity, excellent dimensional clarity, polished surface response, high-end CGI finish, production-grade render quality ^[loopDraftRenderCore == "3D Render" ? 1 : 0]
  masterpiece, best quality, ultra-detailed, highly detailed, refined fantasy painting finish, rich atmospheric fidelity, excellent painterly detail, immersive mythic depth, strong silhouette clarity, production-grade high fantasy illustration quality ^[loopDraftRenderCore == "High Fantasy" ? 1 : 0]

